WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:30.120 --> 01:31.230
[My Journey to You]

01:31.250 --> 01:34.080
[Episode 1]

01:36.560 --> 01:39.160
Did the Gong family send this bridal gown over?

01:39.310 --> 01:39.800
Yes.

01:41.350 --> 01:43.009
It was sent here this morning.

01:43.830 --> 01:46.090
They said we should set off immediately.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.530
It's just a wedding,

01:50.060 --> 01:51.479
why is it so secretive?

01:52.470 --> 01:54.030
Why can't it be above board?

01:54.910 --> 01:56.259
Wufeng is too powerful.

01:57.140 --> 01:58.600
It's better to be careful.

01:59.470 --> 02:01.270
As long as you marry into the Gong family,

02:01.270 --> 02:03.330
no one will dare to bully you anymore.

02:40.390 --> 02:41.120
Don't worry.

02:41.390 --> 02:42.190
He's not dead.

02:42.720 --> 02:44.200
He's only been immobilized.

02:44.200 --> 02:45.400
He will recover soon.

02:49.190 --> 02:51.050
You don't care for modesty at all.

02:51.300 --> 02:52.430
I'm a man after all.

02:53.850 --> 02:55.310
My body belongs to Wufeng,

02:55.810 --> 02:56.920
not myself.

02:57.530 --> 02:58.930
There's nothing to hide.

04:25.910 --> 04:27.530
I'll repeat your mission.

04:27.710 --> 04:28.230
No need.

04:28.790 --> 04:29.540
Han Yasi.

04:30.390 --> 04:31.650
I remember it clearly.

04:32.590 --> 04:34.870
I must say it even if you remember clearly.

04:34.870 --> 04:35.980
This is my duty.

04:44.470 --> 04:45.500
This mission

04:46.409 --> 04:47.470
is rather special.

04:50.710 --> 04:52.310
Is it especially dangerous?

04:52.830 --> 04:53.350
Yes.

04:55.570 --> 04:56.830
But it's worth it.

05:03.540 --> 05:04.720
After this mission,

05:05.280 --> 05:06.620
you can leave Wufeng

05:07.280 --> 05:08.740
and live the life you want.

05:12.590 --> 05:14.910
The Gong family has been living in reclusion in Jiuchen Valley for years.

05:14.910 --> 05:15.980
They are their own sect.

05:15.980 --> 05:17.940
They are not restricted by the rules of the martial world

05:17.940 --> 05:20.070
and treat Wufeng as their sworn enemy.

05:20.530 --> 05:22.910
Jiuchen Valley's terrain is unique and dangerous.

05:22.910 --> 05:25.350
The Gong residence is full of sentries and bunkers.

05:25.350 --> 05:27.010
It's always heavily guarded.

05:27.390 --> 05:28.740
They have guards on shift, day and night,

05:28.740 --> 05:29.600
without break.

05:30.850 --> 05:32.710
It's hard for outsiders to enter.

05:38.460 --> 05:39.320
These are teas.

05:40.270 --> 05:41.600
One of them is medicine.

05:42.190 --> 05:43.720
The five others are poison.

05:46.370 --> 05:47.350
The Gong family

05:47.690 --> 05:49.270
is divided into four legitimate lineages.

05:49.270 --> 05:51.000
They take Gong as their surname

05:51.390 --> 05:53.720
and Shang, Jue, Zhi, and Yu as their names.

05:55.140 --> 05:57.500
The Zhi lineage is adept at using poison and hidden weapons.

05:57.500 --> 05:59.710
The Shang lineage is adept at forging weapons.

05:59.710 --> 06:01.270
The Jue lineage deals with the outside world.

06:01.270 --> 06:03.330
They are in charge of the family business

06:03.330 --> 06:05.230
and the mediation of the martial world.

06:05.230 --> 06:06.580
The Yu lineage deals with defending the interior.

06:06.580 --> 06:09.440
They are in charge of the defense of the Gong family.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.160
That cup is the one with poison.

06:22.830 --> 06:23.470
I know.

06:29.470 --> 06:31.300
For a century, the Gong family has been united

06:31.300 --> 06:33.500
in fighting against the outside world.

06:33.650 --> 06:35.180
They're hard to take apart.

06:36.000 --> 06:36.780
And now,

06:37.320 --> 06:38.250
we finally found

06:38.270 --> 06:40.530
the best way to enter the Gong residence.

06:41.170 --> 06:44.500
Pretending to be a candidate for their selection of a bride.

06:45.650 --> 06:46.850
This is the medicine.

06:52.340 --> 06:53.670
Drink the poison first.

06:53.940 --> 06:55.270
Then take the antidote.

06:55.909 --> 06:57.409
Why don't you take the medicine directly?

06:57.409 --> 07:00.180
If I take the medicine without getting poisoned first,

07:00.180 --> 07:02.240
the medicine will also be poisonous.

07:04.070 --> 07:06.070
After entering the Gong residence,

07:06.370 --> 07:07.370
behind the gates,

07:08.780 --> 07:10.350
you will be alone and helpless

07:10.350 --> 07:11.810
in a dangerous situation.

07:12.470 --> 07:14.070
Everyone will be your enemy.

07:14.790 --> 07:16.390
You can only trust yourself.

07:18.090 --> 07:18.690
Remember,

07:20.450 --> 07:21.720
I mean everyone.

07:24.020 --> 07:24.880
Including you?

07:42.830 --> 07:43.630
Young Master.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.620
Young Master Ziyu.

07:58.470 --> 07:59.550
Gong Ziyu.

08:02.360 --> 08:04.030
A freshly prepared hand furnace.

08:04.030 --> 08:04.590
Here.

08:14.900 --> 08:15.810
It's snowing.

08:18.470 --> 08:19.630
Winter came so early

08:21.150 --> 08:22.160
this year.

08:24.580 --> 08:26.840
You have such good looks for nothing.

08:28.510 --> 08:29.770
You're tall and strong

08:30.100 --> 08:32.100
and you can wield swords and sabers,

08:32.299 --> 08:33.960
but you're afraid of the cold.

08:39.230 --> 08:40.890
You should pack up and go back.

08:41.590 --> 08:42.390
What's wrong?

08:43.309 --> 08:45.710
You have a customer so early in the morning?

08:46.950 --> 08:48.810
Other customers are not like you.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.050
You spend money

08:52.110 --> 08:54.050
but you sleep on the side bed alone.

08:57.830 --> 08:59.030
Of course, I know that

09:00.980 --> 09:02.680
you only come to me

09:03.490 --> 09:04.700
when you are unhappy.

09:07.110 --> 09:08.370
The ancients said that

09:09.930 --> 09:11.460
music can treat illnesses.

09:13.590 --> 09:15.830
After listening to you playing the zither,

09:15.830 --> 09:17.600
all my troubles seem to have disappeared.

09:17.600 --> 09:19.800
Today is the Gong family's wedding day.

09:20.830 --> 09:21.770
Go back now,

09:22.520 --> 09:24.520
or your father will scold you again.

09:30.580 --> 09:32.580
The distance and direction of each footprint

09:32.580 --> 09:33.580
are very precise.

09:34.110 --> 09:35.770
If you walk on the footprints,

09:36.230 --> 09:37.510
you will nail the gait.

09:38.910 --> 09:40.560
Why should I waste time

09:40.840 --> 09:42.640
practicing this useless thing?

09:44.200 --> 09:46.510
To make you look more like a noble lady.

09:48.230 --> 09:49.790
This bride selection is being held

09:49.790 --> 09:52.420
specially for the Young Lord of the Gong family, Gong Huanyu.

09:52.420 --> 09:55.310
He is next in line to inherit the position of Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

09:55.310 --> 09:56.080
Who am I?

09:56.830 --> 09:58.710
You're from a line of famous merchants,

09:58.710 --> 10:00.190
but your family has fallen on bad times.

10:00.190 --> 10:01.230
You're the sole daughter of the Yun family

10:01.230 --> 10:03.890
who's seeking protection from the Gong family,

10:04.470 --> 10:05.220
Yun Weishan.

10:05.940 --> 10:07.310
So your words, actions,

10:07.850 --> 10:08.980
gait, and mannerisms

10:08.980 --> 10:12.010
must be true to that of a lady from a distinguished family.

10:12.010 --> 10:13.270
Your hands are too low.

10:17.350 --> 10:18.770
You must do your best

10:19.500 --> 10:21.900
to make Gong Huanyu choose you as the bride.

10:23.030 --> 10:24.230
But I have a question.

10:27.870 --> 10:29.070
How can you guarantee

10:29.250 --> 10:31.010
Gong Huanyu will choose me?

10:32.870 --> 10:35.230
The Gong family's criterion for choosing brides

10:35.230 --> 10:37.250
is rather unique.

10:38.450 --> 10:41.850
Martial arts sects usually like to form marriage alliances with the strong

10:41.850 --> 10:44.470
to expand their power and influence in the martial arts world.

10:44.470 --> 10:45.750
But the Gong family

10:46.350 --> 10:47.350
never covets

10:47.350 --> 10:50.070
the power of the bride's family in the martial arts world.

10:50.070 --> 10:51.350
The Gong family

10:52.330 --> 10:54.220
doesn't think highly of any sect.

10:55.510 --> 10:56.910
What does the Gong family

10:57.110 --> 10:58.100
value the most?

11:00.630 --> 11:01.890
For some reason,

11:03.800 --> 11:06.000
there are few people in the Gong family.

11:06.190 --> 11:08.120
They don't have many descendants.

11:08.670 --> 11:10.350
Therefore, maintaining their bloodline

11:10.350 --> 11:12.480
has become their ultimate consensus.

11:13.270 --> 11:14.870
Whether the bride is healthy

11:15.360 --> 11:17.890
and can produce offspring for the Gong family

11:18.750 --> 11:20.150
is more important to them

11:20.190 --> 11:22.340
than beauty and family background.

11:24.170 --> 11:25.900
So before the bride selection,

11:26.070 --> 11:27.530
a special physician

11:27.910 --> 11:29.970
will do check-ups for all the brides.

11:33.860 --> 11:36.540
This medicine can strengthen your physique

11:46.560 --> 11:49.090
If Gong Huanyu doesn't choose me as the bride,

11:49.430 --> 11:51.830
does that mean my mission will have failed?

11:53.220 --> 11:54.610
Mostly, yes.

11:57.150 --> 11:58.970
How do I retreat after failure?

12:00.720 --> 12:01.940
There's no way.

12:02.700 --> 12:03.440
If you fail,

12:04.090 --> 12:04.770
you'll die.

12:06.890 --> 12:09.220
You'll be killed either by the Gong family

12:09.430 --> 12:10.670
or by Wufeng.

12:11.790 --> 12:12.590
It's the same.

12:13.040 --> 12:14.240
They're not the same.

12:15.560 --> 12:17.360
Dying by the Gong family's hands

12:18.340 --> 12:19.270
is less painful.

12:25.140 --> 12:26.020
Did I pass?

12:27.310 --> 12:28.840
What else do I have to learn?

12:30.350 --> 12:31.480
There's something.

12:32.540 --> 12:33.270
What else?

12:41.120 --> 12:42.510
[Erotica]

12:48.710 --> 12:50.170
I don't need to learn this.

13:19.310 --> 13:20.750
Why are you here again?

13:22.230 --> 13:23.360
Aren't you here too?

13:24.210 --> 13:25.340
What a coincidence.

13:25.640 --> 13:28.170
It's fine that you're always horsing around,

13:28.520 --> 13:30.690
but you came here on a day like today.

13:31.110 --> 13:32.170
Do you want to die?

13:32.270 --> 13:34.930
The bride isn't here yet. Why are you so anxious?

13:35.390 --> 13:36.390
Are you the bride?

13:38.390 --> 13:39.480
If I were the bride,

13:39.900 --> 13:41.560
I would break your legs

13:41.680 --> 13:42.880
on the wedding night.

13:56.270 --> 13:58.350
Why are you wearing so little when you're afraid of the cold?

13:58.350 --> 13:59.260
You know me.

13:59.590 --> 14:01.110
It's cold in the morning.

14:03.350 --> 14:04.680
You want to strangle me?

14:04.830 --> 14:05.380
Yes.

14:09.320 --> 14:09.880
Get in.

14:17.710 --> 14:18.310
Remember,

14:19.320 --> 14:20.720
your name is Yun Weishan.

14:21.260 --> 14:22.720
You were born in Lixi Town.

14:24.210 --> 14:25.070
No matter what,

14:25.810 --> 14:27.140
no matter what happens,

14:28.100 --> 14:30.500
you must insist that this is your identity.

14:32.570 --> 14:33.570
What will happen?

14:37.570 --> 14:38.460
Han Yasi.

14:38.980 --> 14:41.430
Tomorrow is the day the Gong family opens up the valley

14:41.430 --> 14:42.880
to welcome the brides.

14:43.520 --> 14:46.620
Have you completed the tasks?

14:47.430 --> 14:48.590
All is prepared.

14:49.230 --> 14:50.490
We can set out anytime.

14:51.490 --> 14:53.190
The Wufeng dispatched this time

14:53.190 --> 14:54.450
is called Yun Weishan.

14:55.000 --> 14:57.140
Amongst the Chi, Mei, Wang, and Liang,

14:57.740 --> 14:59.000
she of the lowest rank,

14:59.180 --> 14:59.790
the Chi.

15:00.540 --> 15:01.420
Han Yaqi.

15:02.100 --> 15:02.630
Yes.

15:02.930 --> 15:04.470
You are responsible for heading to

15:04.470 --> 15:06.230
the outpost of the Gong family on our records

15:06.230 --> 15:07.750
to leak the information

15:07.750 --> 15:09.470
that there is a Wufeng agent

15:09.470 --> 15:10.600
amongst the brides.

15:11.320 --> 15:11.850
Also,

15:12.250 --> 15:13.380
you have to make sure

15:13.430 --> 15:15.110
they can bring this information successfully

15:15.110 --> 15:16.440
back to the Gong family.

15:30.050 --> 15:30.830
Who knows?

15:32.230 --> 15:35.010
After all, I've never been inside of the Gong residence.

15:35.010 --> 15:36.810
Everything inside is a mystery.

15:37.310 --> 15:38.310
This mystery will have to be

15:38.310 --> 15:39.400
solved by you.

15:41.230 --> 15:42.310
If I complete the mission—

15:42.310 --> 15:43.610
If you complete the mission,

15:43.610 --> 15:46.340
I will give you the antidote to the Half Moon's Fly

15:50.750 --> 15:52.150
and the freedom you want.

15:54.310 --> 15:54.800
Got it.

15:58.350 --> 15:59.550
Remember what I said.

16:01.280 --> 16:02.140
No matter what,

16:03.490 --> 16:05.350
you must insist on your identity.

16:05.910 --> 16:07.310
Your name is Yun Weishan.

16:08.170 --> 16:09.430
You're from Lixi Town.

16:11.080 --> 16:13.210
The Gong family will pick you up later.

16:26.870 --> 16:27.470
Take care.

16:50.140 --> 16:52.880
It's someone who has undergone the punishment of shaving.

16:52.880 --> 16:54.740
He mustn't have good intentions.

16:57.020 --> 16:59.010
You're new around here.

16:59.630 --> 17:01.090
What would you like to buy?

17:01.710 --> 17:02.910
Do you have a receipt?

17:02.970 --> 17:04.500
Three fen of dinggongteng,

17:05.130 --> 17:06.589
two stalks of jiulixiang,

17:06.720 --> 17:08.050
four liang of jincanzi,

17:09.000 --> 17:09.930
and eight qian of

17:10.589 --> 17:11.609
tiannanxing.

17:12.630 --> 17:13.900
Sir, the herbs you asked for

17:13.900 --> 17:15.930
are hard to find.

17:16.440 --> 17:17.510
Please wait a moment.

17:17.510 --> 17:19.000
I'll check the warehouse.

17:34.540 --> 17:35.980
Don't you want poison?

17:36.950 --> 17:37.810
I gave it to you.

17:38.320 --> 17:39.720
Why are you still hiding?

17:42.040 --> 17:45.190
The poisonous needle is extremely heavy, it must be made of extraordinary iron.

17:45.190 --> 17:48.320
The tip of the needle is colored blue, like the night sky.

17:48.510 --> 17:51.570
This is the Gong family's secret weapon, Midnight Sky.

17:52.770 --> 17:53.410
right?

17:54.090 --> 17:55.220
You know quite a lot.

17:55.700 --> 17:57.120
The poison is blue,

17:57.750 --> 17:59.810
like the color of the sky at midnight.

18:00.230 --> 18:02.090
The poison works extremely fast.

18:02.340 --> 18:05.200
The victim dies before they can scream.

18:07.370 --> 18:08.940
A silent midnight,

18:09.910 --> 18:11.040
no sound to be heard.

18:12.070 --> 18:13.330
That's why it's called

18:14.310 --> 18:15.250
Midnight Sky.

18:17.070 --> 18:18.800
You're really knowledgeable.

18:19.380 --> 18:21.110
Looks like our intel was right.

18:21.790 --> 18:24.160
This is the Gong family's outpost.

19:19.420 --> 19:20.060
Stop!

19:21.090 --> 19:22.420
He's more useful alive.

19:25.120 --> 19:27.120
Are you going to keep fighting back?

19:51.670 --> 19:53.590
Can you stop pulling a long face?

19:54.080 --> 19:55.150
If I look at you too much,

19:55.150 --> 19:57.280
I feel I'll have bad luck the whole day.

19:57.310 --> 19:59.370
Since I became your bodyguard,

19:59.890 --> 20:01.490
I've been unlucky every day.

20:02.190 --> 20:03.350
If you don't like it,

20:03.710 --> 20:05.770
I’ll send you to patrol the mountain.

20:06.640 --> 20:08.040
Thank you, Young Master,

20:08.100 --> 20:09.400
I’ll do as you say.

20:12.090 --> 20:13.290
This guy is so boring.

20:17.090 --> 20:19.590
Search this place thoroughly.

20:19.740 --> 20:24.020
Take all the hidden weapons and poison to Wufeng.

20:24.570 --> 20:26.770
Take inventory and put them in storage.

20:27.300 --> 20:28.630
We're sorting them out.

20:28.950 --> 20:30.150
But the number of hidden weapons

20:30.150 --> 20:30.780
we found remaining

20:30.780 --> 20:33.070
doesn't match the expenditure on the account book.

20:33.070 --> 20:33.710
I think

20:33.710 --> 20:36.350
the Gong family members transported them away ahead of time

20:36.350 --> 20:40.080
because they were rushing to attend the bride selection ceremony.

20:40.250 --> 20:41.560
Ceremony?

20:44.310 --> 20:47.640
It's a rare occurrence for the Gong family to hold a wedding.

20:47.850 --> 20:50.850
I'm afraid they will only be able to hold a funeral now.

20:51.830 --> 20:54.690
They've always been careful when choosing brides.

20:54.710 --> 20:57.910
Even the date of departure is notified at the last moment.

20:57.990 --> 20:59.290
They will never expect

20:59.880 --> 21:01.120
there to be a Wufeng assassin

21:01.120 --> 21:02.900
among the brides.

21:06.240 --> 21:09.040
If Gong Huanyu chooses her as the bride tonight,

21:11.120 --> 21:14.450
we'll be considered affinal kin.

21:21.780 --> 21:22.500
No.

21:24.830 --> 21:27.350
It should be nether kin.

21:47.530 --> 21:48.660
Where is my brother?

21:50.030 --> 21:50.750
Young Lord

21:50.770 --> 21:53.380
has been organizing today's security work since dawn.

21:53.380 --> 21:55.520
Outsiders only get to enter the valley once every 10 years.

21:55.520 --> 21:56.780
No mistake is allowed.

21:57.270 --> 21:58.710
Young Lord is conscientious

21:58.710 --> 21:59.640
and thinks of the

21:59.670 --> 22:00.600
bigger picture.

22:00.870 --> 22:02.190
Unlike a certain someone,

22:02.190 --> 22:04.520
who's busy consorting with prostitutes.

22:04.630 --> 22:06.360
Consorting with prostitutes?

22:06.900 --> 22:08.630
Why do you use such dirty words?

22:09.310 --> 22:11.300
I was just listening to music

22:11.500 --> 22:13.090
and savoring tea.

22:13.940 --> 22:14.710
Besides,

22:14.990 --> 22:16.510
my brother is smart and capable.

22:16.510 --> 22:18.440
He must have arranged everything.

22:18.760 --> 22:20.160
Even if I didn't consort—

22:22.030 --> 22:23.630
Even if I didn't listen to music and savor tea,

22:23.630 --> 22:24.810
what could I do?

22:27.030 --> 22:27.980
I said

22:28.170 --> 22:29.280
"a certain someone".

22:29.280 --> 22:31.010
Why are you so eager to respond?

22:33.960 --> 22:35.630
If you keep being undeferential,

22:35.630 --> 22:37.160
I’ll send you to herd sheep.

22:37.780 --> 22:38.870
Thank you, Young Master,

22:38.870 --> 22:40.090
I’ll do as you say.

22:40.300 --> 22:40.700
You...

22:47.620 --> 22:48.130
Hurry.

22:48.790 --> 22:50.710
Tell Young Lord Huanyu

22:50.950 --> 22:54.230
there is a Wufeng assassin among the brides.

23:01.740 --> 23:03.050
This is the Hundred Herbs Extract!

23:03.050 --> 23:05.580
Is medicine more important than a human life?

23:07.940 --> 23:09.120
Send him back to the clinic immediately.

23:09.120 --> 23:10.400
Go and find Gong Yuanzhi

23:10.400 --> 23:12.530
to see if there is a way to detoxify him.

23:12.630 --> 23:13.090
Okay.

23:13.950 --> 23:16.430
But there's a Wufeng assassin among the brides.

23:16.430 --> 23:19.750
Shouldn't we tell the Sword Wielder about such a serious matter first?

23:19.750 --> 23:20.270
No.

23:20.760 --> 23:22.890
I can't let Father know about this yet.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.710
The Wufeng has done many evil things in the martial arts world.

23:24.710 --> 23:26.230
Father has always hated evil.

23:26.230 --> 23:27.430
If Father finds out

23:27.430 --> 23:29.740
there's a Wufeng assassin among the brides,

23:29.740 --> 23:31.830
all the brides will be doomed.

23:32.420 --> 23:33.420
What should we do?

23:34.060 --> 23:36.060
We must tell him regardless, right?

23:40.270 --> 23:41.470
I'll go find my brother.

23:41.470 --> 23:42.470
He will have a way.

23:44.130 --> 23:45.390
Find Gong Yuanzhi now.

23:55.070 --> 23:56.740
Have they arrived?

23:57.420 --> 23:57.870
Yes.

23:58.820 --> 24:00.830
They have successfully entered Jiuchen Valley.

24:00.830 --> 24:01.620
Han Yaqi.

24:02.030 --> 24:02.880
Chief,

24:03.210 --> 24:04.790
I have attacked the Gong family outpost

24:04.790 --> 24:07.080
according to your orders.

24:07.470 --> 24:08.430
I have also leaked the information

24:08.430 --> 24:11.050
that there is an assassin among the brides

24:11.550 --> 24:13.150
to the person at the outpost.

24:13.340 --> 24:15.560
Does he suspect anything?

24:15.580 --> 24:17.870
The owner of the pharmacy is just as we predicted.

24:17.870 --> 24:18.710
He pretended to

24:18.710 --> 24:20.580
commit suicide by taking poison.

24:21.270 --> 24:22.330
To make him believe

24:22.340 --> 24:24.140
we really wanted to silence him,

24:24.630 --> 24:25.950
as planned,

24:25.950 --> 24:27.740
I stabbed the owner's chest

24:28.010 --> 24:29.770
with that special short sword.

24:30.480 --> 24:31.420
It looked fatal,

24:31.610 --> 24:33.130
but I avoided his vitals.

24:33.930 --> 24:34.940
He won't die.

25:00.470 --> 25:01.660
We also left their fast horses

25:01.660 --> 25:03.480
in the courtyard.

25:03.930 --> 25:05.590
If all goes according to plan,

25:05.710 --> 25:09.240
he should have ridden back to the Gong residence to report back.

25:16.250 --> 25:16.790
Brother!

25:17.550 --> 25:18.430
[Be Upright]

25:17.990 --> 25:19.720
Young Master, Young Lord is...

25:20.070 --> 25:20.600
Brother!

25:33.850 --> 25:34.930
You are getting

25:35.130 --> 25:36.620
more and more impetuous.

25:40.020 --> 25:40.770
Father.

25:41.620 --> 25:42.150
Brother.

25:42.270 --> 25:43.330
It's Sword Wielder

25:44.980 --> 25:45.840
and Young Lord.

25:51.220 --> 25:52.080
Sword Wielder.

25:52.470 --> 25:53.130
Young Lord.

25:53.560 --> 25:54.030
Ziyu,

25:54.330 --> 25:55.260
You're injured?

25:56.500 --> 25:57.900
Your hands are bleeding.

26:00.430 --> 26:01.500
On my way back,

26:01.580 --> 26:02.650
I saved a man from the outpost

26:02.650 --> 26:03.820
who was severely injured.

26:03.820 --> 26:04.820
This is his blood.

26:05.310 --> 26:06.310
He also told me...

26:08.510 --> 26:09.430
What did he say?

26:14.310 --> 26:16.440
He said that there is a Wufeng assassin

26:19.470 --> 26:22.270
among this batch of brides who entered the valley.

26:24.580 --> 26:25.140
Ziyu,

26:25.770 --> 26:27.440
do you know the gravity of what you're saying?

26:27.440 --> 26:28.160
I do.

26:28.390 --> 26:30.250
That's why I came to find Brother—

26:31.180 --> 26:32.270
to find Young Lord.

26:33.380 --> 26:34.920
Did he say who hurt him?

26:35.130 --> 26:36.330
What was his purpose?

26:38.500 --> 26:40.860
Where did he get the intel that there's an assassin

26:40.860 --> 26:41.860
among the brides?

26:42.580 --> 26:44.180
I haven't had time to ask him.

26:44.830 --> 26:46.290
Where is the injured guard

26:46.790 --> 26:47.470
now?

26:48.630 --> 26:49.430
In the clinic.

26:50.260 --> 26:51.760
Although the blade was thin,

26:51.760 --> 26:53.690
it was smeared with lethal poison.

26:54.450 --> 26:56.980
The poison will take effect after four hours.

26:57.010 --> 26:59.340
According to the speed of that fast horse,

26:59.540 --> 27:02.400
it should be enough for him to reach Jiuchen Valley.

27:03.250 --> 27:03.750
So,

27:04.790 --> 27:06.060
he only has time

27:06.560 --> 27:09.260
to communicate this piece of information he believes completely,

27:09.260 --> 27:14.350
that there's a Wufeng assassin among the brides,

27:16.930 --> 27:17.950
before he dies.

27:20.280 --> 27:23.280
The Gong family won't be able to ask about the details.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.820
A dying person's words

27:25.870 --> 27:26.850
must be true.

27:28.200 --> 27:29.150
No one will doubt

27:29.180 --> 27:30.910
the last words of a dead person.

27:31.880 --> 27:32.780
Good.

27:33.280 --> 27:34.200
Now,

27:34.220 --> 27:36.710
it's really good.

27:45.630 --> 27:46.490
Sword Wielder,

27:47.920 --> 27:49.300
he's dead.

27:54.630 --> 27:56.430
We must find

27:56.430 --> 27:57.190
the Wufeng assassin

27:57.190 --> 27:58.190
among the brides.

27:59.510 --> 28:00.040
Brother.

28:00.470 --> 28:02.260
There are so many brides. Do you have any clues?

28:02.260 --> 28:03.320
How can we find her?

28:03.510 --> 28:05.170
There's no need to take risks.

28:05.230 --> 28:06.640
Just execute them all.

28:15.780 --> 28:17.440
Please forgive my ignorance.

28:18.790 --> 28:19.990
Although Yun Weishan

28:20.750 --> 28:22.480
is of the lowest level, the Chi,

28:23.150 --> 28:25.480
I've painstakingly trained her for years

28:26.790 --> 28:29.190
and expended a lot of resources and effort.

28:29.660 --> 28:32.390
Voluntarily exposing her identity like this...

28:34.440 --> 28:35.570
I don't understand.

28:36.380 --> 28:38.230
It's hard to clap with a single hand.

28:38.230 --> 28:39.560
Wolves travel in pairs.

28:40.400 --> 28:42.130
This is such an important task.

28:43.180 --> 28:45.410
How can we entrust it to just one person?

28:48.090 --> 28:50.270
Another Wufeng that I trained

28:50.670 --> 28:53.040
also entered the valley

28:53.290 --> 28:54.560
as a bride today.

28:55.740 --> 28:56.450
And...

28:58.650 --> 29:00.780
I think she's more likely to succeed.

29:02.620 --> 29:03.240
After all,

29:03.990 --> 29:04.650
she is a Mei.

29:06.390 --> 29:08.590
find this Wufeng today.

29:08.790 --> 29:10.360
When one Wufeng dies,

29:10.510 --> 29:12.770
the other will be safer.

29:16.900 --> 29:19.230
The Gong family has always been cautious.

29:19.330 --> 29:20.790
If they kill all the brides

29:21.740 --> 29:23.260
to be safe,

29:24.990 --> 29:26.020
wouldn't our plan

29:26.260 --> 29:27.540
have all been in vain?

29:28.000 --> 29:28.930
Not really.

29:29.500 --> 29:31.360
The Gong family isn't the Wufeng.

29:37.770 --> 29:38.320
Father.

29:39.300 --> 29:39.850
Father!

29:41.540 --> 29:43.870
If we kill all the brides because of an assassin,

29:43.870 --> 29:44.900
if we kill innocent people indiscriminately like that,

29:44.900 --> 29:47.270
what will be the difference between us and the Wufeng?

29:47.270 --> 29:47.810
Father!

29:49.630 --> 29:51.430
That assassin sneaked into the Gong residence

29:51.430 --> 29:53.150
to kill the Gong family.

29:53.630 --> 29:55.820
You think the murderer is innocent?

29:56.380 --> 29:57.870
What about the other brides?

29:57.870 --> 29:59.470
Not everyone is an assassin.

30:00.910 --> 30:02.270
I've been making my way in the world my whole life.

30:02.270 --> 30:03.870
I've taken my fair share of risks.

30:03.870 --> 30:04.260
But

30:04.670 --> 30:07.210
I will never risk my family's lives.

30:07.470 --> 30:09.540
Even if there's only an infinitesimal danger,

30:09.540 --> 30:10.530
I won't allow it.

30:11.600 --> 30:13.060
Just lock up all the brides

30:13.260 --> 30:14.520
and find the assassin.

30:14.910 --> 30:16.030
If all brides die tragically overnight

30:16.030 --> 30:18.030
after entering the Gong residence,

30:18.230 --> 30:19.230
how will people in the martial arts world

30:19.230 --> 30:20.630
think of the Gong family?

30:21.470 --> 30:22.800
The martial arts world?

30:23.000 --> 30:24.260
The martial arts world

30:24.470 --> 30:26.390
fears the Wufeng so much that

30:26.410 --> 30:28.310
they no longer distinguish good from bad.

30:28.310 --> 30:30.490
The Gong family hasn't surrendered

30:30.720 --> 30:31.920
and is standing alone

30:32.380 --> 30:33.530
because

30:34.310 --> 30:35.590
I'm cautious.

30:42.520 --> 30:43.370
Go back first.

30:43.670 --> 30:44.930
I'll come to you later.

30:49.770 --> 30:50.430
Jin Fan.

30:53.510 --> 30:54.110
Follow me.

31:04.260 --> 31:07.180
[Guardian Camp]

31:11.560 --> 31:12.070
Water.

31:12.430 --> 31:13.040
No need.

31:20.680 --> 31:21.310
No need.

31:21.350 --> 31:22.410
Eldest Young Miss.

31:25.310 --> 31:25.990
Eldest Young Miss.

31:25.990 --> 31:26.450
No need.

31:26.650 --> 31:27.710
Eldest Young Miss.

31:27.800 --> 31:28.460
No need.

31:30.170 --> 31:30.760
No need.

31:32.430 --> 31:33.010
No need.

31:33.550 --> 31:34.670
No need to put it on.

31:38.950 --> 31:39.880
Where is Jin Fan?

31:40.380 --> 31:42.070
Brother Jin Fan hasn't come back yet.

31:42.070 --> 31:43.200
How inappropriate!

31:43.870 --> 31:45.270
It's dangerous outside.

31:45.800 --> 31:47.000
You boys need to

31:47.380 --> 31:48.990
learn to protect yourselves.

31:48.990 --> 31:49.720
Understand?

31:50.080 --> 31:52.810
We will protect Eldest Young Miss with our lives.

31:53.510 --> 31:54.870
I will also protect you.

31:55.350 --> 31:56.080
Don't worry.

31:56.620 --> 31:57.350
Don't worry.

32:01.070 --> 32:02.290
Where is Jin Fan?

32:03.030 --> 32:04.150
When I came back,

32:04.180 --> 32:06.270
I saw Brother Jin Fan and Young Master Ziyu

32:06.270 --> 32:07.540
going out in a hurry.

32:08.180 --> 32:10.360
Why did Jin Fan and Gong Ziyu

32:10.380 --> 32:12.260
go out so late at night?

32:13.790 --> 32:14.550
Come here.

32:14.550 --> 32:15.630
Keep practicing for me.

32:15.630 --> 32:16.960
Yes, Eldest Young Miss.

36:27.620 --> 36:30.690
[Feng]

39:18.310 --> 39:19.170
Stop touching.

39:19.760 --> 39:21.420
The arrows were blunt arrows.

39:21.460 --> 39:22.890
They struck our acupoints

39:22.890 --> 39:24.290
and made us unconscious.

39:25.980 --> 39:27.180
Remember what I said.

39:28.270 --> 39:29.190
No matter what,

39:30.510 --> 39:32.370
you must insist on your identity.

39:32.980 --> 39:34.380
Your name is Yun Weishan.

39:35.300 --> 39:36.560
You're from Lixi Town.

39:42.140 --> 39:43.830
You stopped yourself from speaking.

39:43.830 --> 39:45.090
What do you want to say?

39:46.150 --> 39:46.970
Why do you keep saying

39:46.970 --> 39:48.570
I must insist on my identity?

39:49.480 --> 39:51.140
From what I know about Wufeng,

39:52.310 --> 39:54.840
you're not the only bride they're sending in.

39:55.460 --> 39:57.120
There should be someone else.

39:58.710 --> 40:00.010
Is this how the Gong family

40:00.010 --> 40:02.190
treats the brides that marry into their family?

40:02.190 --> 40:03.670
They were really sweet-talking us

40:03.670 --> 40:05.310
when they sent the betrothal gifts.

40:05.310 --> 40:07.100
I've only left home for a few hours,

40:07.100 --> 40:09.760
and I'm locked in this stinky, rundown dungeon.

40:09.870 --> 40:11.000
That's ridiculous.

40:11.750 --> 40:13.010
If my father finds out,

40:13.010 --> 40:14.290
he won't let you off!

40:27.590 --> 40:28.250
Young Lord.

40:29.350 --> 40:30.410
Father is not here.

40:30.820 --> 40:31.930
It's just the two of us.

40:31.930 --> 40:33.730
Don't make it hard for yourself.

40:35.670 --> 40:36.200
Brother.

40:36.320 --> 40:37.260
What's going on?

40:37.780 --> 40:39.220
Father's temper...

40:39.390 --> 40:40.080
Sigh.

40:40.340 --> 40:41.250
What did he say?

40:42.600 --> 40:43.470
They won't die.

40:44.460 --> 40:45.860
But it's won't be pretty.

40:49.070 --> 40:50.670
He wants to use poison again?

40:53.030 --> 40:53.570
Yes.

40:54.910 --> 40:57.400
Gong Yuanzhi concocted a new drug recently.

40:58.070 --> 41:00.130
I guess it'll come into use tomorrow.

41:01.690 --> 41:02.220
Brother,

41:02.270 --> 41:03.770
I know you are soft-hearted.

41:03.770 --> 41:06.100
But we have to find out who the assassin is.

41:06.920 --> 41:09.250
Who can withstand Gong Yuanzhi's poison?

41:09.510 --> 41:11.310
What's the difference between poison and torture?

41:11.310 --> 41:13.010
Someone will definitely not be able to bear it and confess

41:13.010 --> 41:14.270
or frame someone else.

41:16.060 --> 41:17.660
There's still a difference.

41:18.230 --> 41:20.100
Torture will leave scars.

41:20.360 --> 41:21.620
It's better for brides

41:21.790 --> 41:23.360
to be pretty.

41:25.520 --> 41:27.780
Don't you like girls with good skin?

41:28.900 --> 41:29.550
Brother.

41:30.330 --> 41:32.330
It's not the time to talk about this.

41:32.940 --> 41:33.510
No.

41:34.310 --> 41:35.770
I need to ask Father again.

41:35.990 --> 41:36.650
Nonsense!

41:38.910 --> 41:40.070
What time is it now?

41:41.830 --> 41:43.070
Father is asleep.

41:45.820 --> 41:46.590
You

41:47.530 --> 41:49.390
are already of marriageable age,

41:49.550 --> 41:51.210
but you're still so reckless.

41:51.520 --> 41:52.980
You should be more mature.

41:55.350 --> 41:56.480
You'd better take on

41:56.550 --> 41:59.070
some of the Gong family's matters as soon as possible

41:59.070 --> 42:00.110
I don't want to.

42:02.860 --> 42:03.630
You...

42:03.980 --> 42:05.910
You can only say that in front of me.

42:06.390 --> 42:08.990
Don't mention it in front of Father and others.

42:09.560 --> 42:10.620
Why can't I?

42:11.830 --> 42:12.770
Father never intended for me

42:12.770 --> 42:15.100
to involved in the Gong family's affairs.

42:15.640 --> 42:16.500
Besides, no one

42:17.130 --> 42:19.730
thinks of me as a descendant of the Gong family.

42:32.510 --> 42:33.350
A few days ago,

42:33.560 --> 42:35.290
the north sent over a wild mink.

42:35.780 --> 42:36.490
I asked someone

42:36.490 --> 42:38.150
to make a thick cloak out of it.

42:39.250 --> 42:41.980
The night dew in the valley has been heavy lately.

42:42.150 --> 42:44.320
You've get cold easily since young.

42:45.190 --> 42:46.390
If you go out at night,

42:46.860 --> 42:47.710
put it on.

42:49.760 --> 42:50.290
Brother.

42:50.310 --> 42:51.120
But the brides...

42:51.120 --> 42:52.550
Our discussion on the brides

42:52.550 --> 42:53.490
is over.

42:54.260 --> 42:55.320
I'm going to sleep.

43:12.580 --> 43:13.180
How was it?

43:13.240 --> 43:14.570
What did Young Lord say?

43:15.430 --> 43:16.030
Tomorrow,

43:16.630 --> 43:18.290
they'll poison all the brides

43:19.170 --> 43:20.770
with Gong Yuanzhi's poison.

43:21.710 --> 43:23.440
If it's Gong Yuanzhi's poison,

43:24.070 --> 43:26.540
we can definitely find out who the assassin is.

43:26.540 --> 43:27.070
No.

43:29.460 --> 43:30.350
It's too cruel.

43:31.540 --> 43:32.540
What should we do?

43:33.630 --> 43:35.560
It's better than killing them all.

43:43.710 --> 43:44.600
Do you remember

43:46.170 --> 43:48.320
when my father grounded me for a month last year

43:48.320 --> 43:50.030
and you found an abandoned secret passage

43:50.030 --> 43:51.470
to help me escape?

43:52.070 --> 43:52.870
Are you crazy?

43:55.830 --> 43:58.020
I will never allow you to do that.

44:01.500 --> 44:02.300
Young Master Ziyu.

44:02.300 --> 44:03.230
Why are you here?

44:06.830 --> 44:08.300
Young Lord asked me to take these girls

44:08.300 --> 44:11.550
to the Zhi lineage for Gong Yuanzhi to test his medicine on.

44:11.550 --> 44:13.690
He's testing medicine so late at night?

44:13.690 --> 44:14.420
How dare you!

44:14.790 --> 44:17.450
It's not up to you to decide whether it's too late.

44:17.450 --> 44:18.160
I dare not.

44:18.470 --> 44:18.980
But...

44:19.610 --> 44:21.970
Young Lord could have sent someone to inform us.

44:21.970 --> 44:23.950
Young Master Ziyu didn't have to come in person.

44:23.950 --> 44:25.150
Do you mean to say

44:25.520 --> 44:27.080
Young Lord thinks of me as a servant?

44:27.080 --> 44:27.910
Please don't be angry.

44:27.910 --> 44:28.730
I deserve to die.

44:28.730 --> 44:30.030
Enough.

44:30.520 --> 44:31.280
I'm going in.

45:23.640 --> 45:24.570
Don't be afraid.

45:24.870 --> 45:26.000
I'm here to save you.

45:26.790 --> 45:27.590
Young Master.

45:27.990 --> 45:29.440
What happened?

45:33.030 --> 45:34.350
There is a Wufeng assassin

45:34.350 --> 45:35.750
among you.

45:37.490 --> 45:38.390
What is Wufeng?

45:39.030 --> 45:40.430
You don't even know that?

45:40.710 --> 45:41.870
Wufeng is an assassin organization

45:41.870 --> 45:43.470
that has dominated the martial arts world for decades.

45:43.470 --> 45:45.070
Whoever dares to resist them

45:45.380 --> 45:46.610
will be killed.

45:46.730 --> 45:48.880
Many sects have already surrendered to Wufeng.

45:48.880 --> 45:51.190
Only the Gong family is left to resist them.

45:51.190 --> 45:53.630
That's why my father sent me here for the bride selection.

45:53.630 --> 45:54.360
He said

45:54.650 --> 45:57.260
this is the only safe place Wufeng can't reach.

45:57.790 --> 45:58.590
That's right.

45:59.250 --> 46:00.910
Wufeng is cruel and ruthless.

46:01.130 --> 46:02.080
After the Sword Wielder

46:02.080 --> 46:03.140
found out there's a Wufeng agent

46:03.140 --> 46:04.530
among you,

46:05.200 --> 46:06.910
in order to protect the Gong family,

46:06.910 --> 46:08.710
he decided to execute all of you.

46:13.730 --> 46:14.990
How could this happen?

46:17.220 --> 46:18.550
It's not the time to cry.

46:20.140 --> 46:20.930
Come with me.

46:21.320 --> 46:22.250
I'll let you out.

46:23.060 --> 46:24.990
They called you Young Master Ziyu.

46:25.070 --> 46:26.670
You are the Young Master of the Yu lineage,

46:26.670 --> 46:28.270
the son of the Sword Wielder.

46:29.440 --> 46:30.780
Your father wants to kill us,

46:30.780 --> 46:31.960
but you want to save us.

46:31.960 --> 46:33.160
How can you be so kind?

46:33.270 --> 46:34.400
I don't believe you.

46:35.280 --> 46:37.150
I'm neither the Sword Wielder nor the Young Lord.

46:37.150 --> 46:39.300
That's why I have protective feelings for the fairer sex.

46:39.300 --> 46:40.310
You can decide

46:40.550 --> 46:42.410
whether you want to leave with me.

46:43.420 --> 46:44.350
I'll go with you.

46:44.600 --> 46:46.400
I want to go back to see my father.

46:53.350 --> 46:55.010
Thank you, Young Master Ziyu.

47:25.090 --> 47:25.690
Come here.

47:29.390 --> 47:31.050
Young Lord's men are outside.

47:31.070 --> 47:32.600
You don't have to follow us.

47:33.960 --> 47:35.040
Go

47:35.720 --> 47:37.870
search every cell carefully

47:38.350 --> 47:40.610
and see if there are any strange objects,

47:40.680 --> 47:42.670
like hidden weapons.

47:43.870 --> 47:44.300
Yes.

47:49.260 --> 47:49.920
Young Lord.

47:49.950 --> 47:50.610
Young Lord.

47:50.980 --> 47:51.640
Young Lord.

47:52.160 --> 47:53.360
Young Master Ziyu...

47:53.390 --> 47:55.810
Young Master Ziyu brougt the brides out of the dungeon.

47:55.810 --> 47:56.440
Now,

47:57.130 --> 47:59.530
they're walking out of the Gong residence.

48:59.490 --> 49:00.550
What are you doing?

49:01.310 --> 49:03.350
The Gong residence is full of sentries.

49:03.350 --> 49:05.950
If you go any further, you will be shot to death.

49:06.110 --> 49:07.240
I don't believe you.

49:09.070 --> 49:09.870
Then go ahead.

49:11.270 --> 49:12.230
I want to see

49:12.620 --> 49:13.880
you become a hedgehog.

49:16.660 --> 49:17.520
I don't believe

49:19.110 --> 49:20.770
you really want to take us out.

49:22.870 --> 49:24.240
How do I look insincere?

49:25.950 --> 49:27.210
When the boat stopped,

49:28.150 --> 49:29.720
I saw the lighthouse.

49:30.810 --> 49:31.950
I remember it

49:32.560 --> 49:33.930
was near the city gate.

49:34.550 --> 49:35.210
But now,

49:36.110 --> 49:38.380
we are getting farther and farther from the city gate.

49:38.380 --> 49:39.710
You are so distrusting.

49:42.750 --> 49:43.630
Mother told me

49:44.620 --> 49:45.680
not to trust anyone

49:46.740 --> 49:48.270
after entering the valley.

49:49.560 --> 49:50.280
Besides,

49:51.300 --> 49:53.570
it's strange that

49:54.020 --> 49:56.150
you will disobey your father's orders

49:56.920 --> 49:57.840
to let us out.

49:59.400 --> 50:00.370
In that case,

50:00.860 --> 50:02.330
isn't it also strange that

50:02.360 --> 50:05.030
you've been memorizing the position of the lighthouse

50:05.030 --> 50:07.160
since you entered the Gong residence?

50:07.320 --> 50:08.050
Who's there?

50:14.970 --> 50:16.030
Hold on to the mask.

50:20.020 --> 50:21.080
Young Master Ziyu?

50:22.150 --> 50:22.790
It's late.

50:22.790 --> 50:24.540
What is Young Master Ziyu doing?

50:24.540 --> 50:26.400
Sister Zishang got bitten by some bugs

50:26.400 --> 50:27.640
on her face.

50:28.270 --> 50:30.000
The bites are a little swollen.

50:30.230 --> 50:31.290
She was depressed,

50:31.510 --> 50:33.570
so she asked me to take a walk with her.

50:33.670 --> 50:35.000
It's Eldest Young Miss.

50:35.300 --> 50:37.180
The Gong residence is under full alert tonight.

50:37.180 --> 50:38.540
Please don't wander around.

50:38.540 --> 50:40.110
Go back to your room and rest.

50:40.110 --> 50:40.580
Okay.

50:41.240 --> 50:42.000
You may leave.

50:42.000 --> 50:43.000
We'll go back now.

50:43.230 --> 50:43.710
Yes.

50:55.610 --> 50:56.670
Do you trust me now?

51:00.750 --> 51:02.880
If I didn't really want to send you out,

51:03.110 --> 51:05.440
I could have handed you over to the guards.

51:06.670 --> 51:08.330
If you still don't believe me,

51:08.670 --> 51:09.950
then keep going

51:10.850 --> 51:11.430
and

51:12.180 --> 51:13.240
become a hedgehog.

51:20.350 --> 51:21.790
If you really want to get out,

51:21.790 --> 51:22.520
come with me.

51:35.760 --> 51:37.290
When are you taking us away?

51:37.550 --> 51:38.980
Didn't you say you'd take us away?

51:38.980 --> 51:40.380
What are you waiting for?

51:42.870 --> 51:44.000
Where have you been?

51:45.350 --> 51:46.890
You disappeared when I turned around.

51:46.890 --> 51:47.750
How reckless.

51:48.110 --> 51:49.830
There's an assassin among them.

51:49.830 --> 51:50.890
You think too much.

51:51.830 --> 51:53.780
It's not easy for the Wufeng assassin to sneak in.

51:53.780 --> 51:55.510
How could she be here to kill me?

51:55.960 --> 51:56.620
Also,

51:57.160 --> 51:59.150
exposing themeslves by killing

51:59.150 --> 52:00.350
an idle man like me...

52:00.430 --> 52:01.430
Is Wufeng stupid?

52:01.830 --> 52:02.990
If you're so careless, it'll be easy—

52:02.990 --> 52:03.520
Alright.

52:03.670 --> 52:04.200
Let's go.

52:32.160 --> 52:33.290
This secret passage

52:33.350 --> 52:34.950
leads out of Jinchen Valley.

52:35.360 --> 52:36.850
But there are many traps inside.

52:36.850 --> 52:37.810
Be careful.

52:42.720 --> 52:43.610
Gong Ziyu.

53:01.860 --> 53:04.030
Aren't you sending me people to test my medicine on?

53:04.030 --> 53:05.420
Why are they here?

53:05.840 --> 53:07.460
I'm acting under Young Lord's orders.

53:07.460 --> 53:08.620
I don't need to explain myself to you.

53:08.620 --> 53:09.840
Are you following orders

53:09.840 --> 53:11.070
or falsely relaying orders?

53:11.070 --> 53:12.190
You know very well!

53:12.550 --> 53:13.000
Go!
